                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A player who occupies one of these positions.",
                                            "An offensive back whose primary jobs are to carry the ball on running plays and to serve as a receiver or blocker on passing plays."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "45770541-93f5-3c9d-a2d3-acc8df9b9f4d",
                                        "entry_id": "a737b126-0e30-3b7a-bd79-d2d626d54b22",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A player who occupies one of these positions.",
                                            "A defensive back whose primary jobs are to cover the slotback on passing plays and prevent running plays from going to the outside."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Canadian"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f4909421-ac72-3378-bf72-092e8de2b5a6",
                                        "entry_id": "a737b126-0e30-3b7a-bd79-d2d626d54b22",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A player who occupies one of these positions.",
                                            "A player in the halfback position, with both offensive and defensive roles."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9a14b354-a3e2-35ae-9209-039f1eef4bbb",
                                        "entry_id": "a737b126-0e30-3b7a-bd79-d2d626d54b22",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A player who occupies one of these positions.",
                                            "One of three players (the centre halfback and two halfback flankers) on the line between the centre line and the fullback line."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "86810e4e-5d4a-322b-ae27-0440d1a0e7e0",
                                        "entry_id": "a737b126-0e30-3b7a-bd79-d2d626d54b22",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A player who occupies one of these positions.",
                                            "The player who feeds the ball into the scrum, and receives the ball as it emerges from the back of the scrum."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ed6d14dc-d4bc-3062-9afd-7bd837e6c6cd",
                                        "entry_id": "a737b126-0e30-3b7a-bd79-d2d626d54b22",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person from the northern United States who moves to Florida, but then due to the heat or other issues, moves again to a more temperate climate, primarily the Carolinas."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "393e6c3d-6625-48ad-9c5f-da13ab34e34e",
                                                "sense_id": "ed6d14dc-d4bc-3062-9afd-7bd837e6c6cd",
                                                "text": "Four years ago, Diane got a small inheritance and they became what Paul Klein calls “halfbacks” — people who moved to Florida from the North and have progressed partly back."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2bd7ec90-f400-4ec9-8d81-ad397c778f4a",
                                                "sense_id": "ed6d14dc-d4bc-3062-9afd-7bd837e6c6cd",
                                                "text": "One of my favorite stories of North Carolina’s demographic growth and change is the “halfback.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0969e3b2-3bcd-4387-9bd8-1dd5c4781485",
                                                "sense_id": "ed6d14dc-d4bc-3062-9afd-7bd837e6c6cd",
                                                "text": "“‘Halfbacks’ are snowbirds from Michigan who have tried wintering in Florida but decided to move…half way back."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
